## User

The sum of all the values in a tree.

## Context

```haskell
data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)
```

## Type

type
```haskell
treeSum :: Num a => Tree a -> a
```

## Term

```haskell
treeSum (Leaf) = 0
treeSum (Node l x r) = x + treeSum l + treeSum r
```

